  "id": "cmpl-2ff2d0c3c0124ea38a9a8cf65a1109a7",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754620260,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "6663.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **99** and **67**, we can use the distributive property to simplify the multiplication. Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n99 \\times 67 &= (100 - 1) \\times 67 \\\\\n&= 100 \\times 67 - 1 \\times 67 \\\\\n&= 6700 - 67 \\\\\n&= 6633\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{6633}\n\\]",
      "logprobs": null,
      "finish_reason": "stop",
