messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 99 and 81?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 99 and 81, I can use the distributive property to simplify the multiplication.\n\nFirst, I'll break down 99 into 100 minus 1. This makes the multiplication easier.\n\nNext, I'll distribute 81 across the two terms: 100 times 81 and 1 times 81.\n\nCalculating each part separately, I get 8100 and 81.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract the smaller number from the larger one to find the final product.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
