  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754620389,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "1250 + 50 = 1300.\n</think>\n\n**Solution:**\n\nTo find the product of 25 and 52, follow these easy steps:\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**\n   \n   \\[\n   25 \\times 52 = 25 \\times (50 + 2)\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 25 by each part separately:**\n   \n   \\[\n   25 \\times 50 = 1250\n   \\]\n   \n   \\[\n   25 \\times 2 = 50\n   \\]\n\n3. **Add the results together:**\n   \n   \\[\n   1250 + 50 = 1300\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1300}\n\\]",
