      "text": "4464.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **62** and **72**, we'll use the **distributive property** (also known as the **FOIL method** for binomials). Here's a step-by-step solution:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n62 \\times 72 &= (60 + 2) \\times (70 + 2) \\\\\n&= 60 \\times 70 + 60 \\times 2 + 2 \\times 70 + 2 \\times 2 \\\\\n&= 4200 + 120 + 140 + 4 \\\\\n&= 4200 + 120 = 4320 \\\\\n4320 + 140 &= 4460 \\\\\n4460 + 4 &= 4464 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\[\n\\boxed{4464}\n\\]",
